  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal multiprofile models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_031) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.6776). This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder with scgpt (a more complex representation) while keeping other parameters identical isolates the impact of RNA encoder choice. It directly compares a promising baseline with a potentially more expressive encoder, addressing uncertainty about whether advanced representations improve performance without altering other critical components."
